# MedBoard Administrator Console is protected by HTTP Basic Auth.
# Credentials live in the staff-shared private/ directory (not ideal, but that's
# how the previous admin left it before offboarding).
#
# Offboarding note: the previous admin also left recovery/handover details in
#   private/recovery_note.txt   (same folder as the password file). Do not expose.
AuthType Basic
AuthName "Talad Phra Administrator Console"
AuthUserFile /var/www/html/private/.htpasswd
Require valid-user
